01:47:29,220 --> 01:47:31,220
Mesajdan bakarsan eğer.

900
01:47:31,220 --> 01:47:33,220
Sizinki de [öğrenci].

901
01:47:33,220 --> 01:47:35,220
[öğrenci].

902
