01:47:53,300 --> 01:47:55,300
O zaman biz devam edelim yani.

910
01:47:55,300 --> 01:47:57,300
Bende de [öğrenci]'den bir tepki gelmedi.

911
01:47:57,300 --> 01:47:59,300
Okey.

912
01:47:59,300 --> 01:48:03,300
